WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:21.710
Hey youtubers, what’s up.

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:30.510
This is going to be a breakdown of the new
trailer.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.239
As you can see very Rogue centric.

00:00:33.239 --> 00:00:37.089
The footage is only from the next couple of
episodes.

00:00:37.089 --> 00:00:41.889
There’s info on all these episodes, just
to provide some better context I’ll do this

00:00:41.889 --> 00:00:43.760
in order of each episode.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:49.489
So I’ll be talking about characters we do
not see in the trailer too.

00:00:49.489 --> 00:00:54.440
There’s a ton of new comic book people that
we’ll be seeing.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.499
This trailer only shows Pied Piper, Heatwave,
Captain Cold which everyone already knows

00:00:57.499 --> 00:00:59.209
about and this girl is probably Peek-A-Boo.

00:00:59.209 --> 00:01:00.899
Starting with Episode 10 Revenge of the Rogues.

00:01:00.899 --> 00:01:01.899
That’s what this footage is from.

00:01:01.899 --> 00:01:04.600
Captain Cold and Heatwave team up.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:08.530
The title is a play on Geoff John’s Rogues’
Revenge storyline from Final Crisis.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:17.660
I’ll be interested to see if the episode
has anything to do with the comic story.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:25.680
It involves the Bart Allen Flash, the Hunter
Zolomon Zoom and some Rogues we haven’t

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:28.140
seen on screen yet.

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:32.040
In addition to Heatwave and Captain Cold we’ll
see Osgood and Rachel Rathaway, In the comics,

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:35.490
they’re the parents of Hartley Rathaway,
who becomes the Pied Piper.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:39.560
They’re a wealthy family that spends their
fortune trying to cure their son’s deafness.

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:45.820
He was born deaf, but on the show Pied Piper
is going to be more like Blackout from Episode

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:49.300
7, he’ll be another Star Labs employee that
was given powers in the blast.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:53.170
I’ve already done a video for Heatwave so
if you want to learn more about him I’ll

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:54.180
add a link in the description.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:57.170
Actually, a lot of these characters I’ve
done bonus videos for so just in general,

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.460
check the description for bonus links.

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:01.110
Episode 10 is mostly about introducing the
Heatwave character.

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:04.310
On that same coin, Jason Rusch is debuting.

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:08.470
I don’t know if it’s in a flashback or
in present day.

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:16.609
The way the producers explained it, is that
he was part of Project Firestorm with Professor

00:02:16.609 --> 00:02:18.969
Martin Stein and Ronnie Raymond.

00:02:18.969 --> 00:02:28.010
So they’ll probably end up using him to
develop the Firestorm plotline.

00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:39.660
Episode 11 is called The Sound and the Fury.

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.939
This is part 1 of a two part Pied Piper story.

00:02:41.939 --> 00:02:44.569
His character will also be in the next episode
after this.

00:02:44.569 --> 00:02:52.909
Fun Fact, he’s actually the boyfriend of
Captain Singh.

00:02:52.909 --> 00:02:53.909
Barry’s boss.

00:02:53.909 --> 00:02:58.029
I’ll be interested to see how he reacts
to learning his boyfriend turns into a super

00:02:58.029 --> 00:03:03.500
powered criminal.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:08.520
Episode 12 is more Pied Piper and Martin Stein.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:11.709
I don’t know if it will be flashback martin
stein or present day.

00:03:11.709 --> 00:03:14.989
But Robbie Amell isn’t on the cast list.

00:03:14.989 --> 00:03:20.250
We also meet this girl, I think this is Peek-A-Boo
from the comics.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.810
She has powers of teleportation.

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:25.950
She’s not listed on the IMDB page but in
the comics, her character has a boyfriend

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:28.419
named Clay Parker who’s stuck in Iron Heights
Prison.

00:03:28.419 --> 00:03:32.750
And he uses her to commit crimes but she’s
not an evil character.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:49.219
Drum Roll please, because Linda Park is also
supposed to be in the episode.

00:03:49.219 --> 00:03:56.629
In the comics, she becomes the wife of the
Wally West Flash.

00:03:56.629 --> 00:04:17.290
She’s a reporter and Candice Patton’s
Iris West character is going to be working

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:18.290
as a reporter.

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:25.940
So we’ll probably meet Linda Park at the
place Iris works for.

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:34.450
They haven’t made any definitive statements
about Wally West other than they will do him

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.190
on the show.

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:39.490
Introducing Linda Park this early is just
them laying groundwork for that.

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:44.050
I know everyone is wondering how they’ll
explain Wally West because of the changes

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:50.770
they’ve made to the West family from the
comics.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:54.500
I think the best options are to make Wally
Iris’ Cousin from out of town.

00:04:54.500 --> 00:05:01.360
That way he wouldn’t have to be on the show
all the time.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:07.730
Otherwise every episode people would keep
asking why Wally isn’t around.

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:09.680
That’s like Season 2 stuff, maybe even Season
3.

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:14.720
I don’t think they’re ready to start introducing
more people with Flash powers, they’ve already

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:17.790
got 3 including the Reverse Flashes.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:21.480
That’s pretty much it for this trailer.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:24.710
I think based on these characters there isn’t
any footage beyond episode 12.

00:05:24.710 --> 00:05:26.480
So here’s my question for you guys.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:37.480
If they’re doing Linda Park, do you want
to see Carol Ferris at some point.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:49.210
I don’t think DC will let them do Green
Lantern, because they’re doing a new Green

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:51.040
Lantern/Flash movie in a couple years.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:56.320
But they could do Carol Ferris.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:06:02.300
There’s also an Arrow trailer just like
this with footage for the next couple of episodes

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:04.800
so I’m going to do the same thing for that
next.

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.240
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:12.700
Agent Carter had a really strong start but
Flash and Arrow are still the most fun comic

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:13.700
book shows on tv right now.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:16.050
I won’t say best because I always change
my mind every week.

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:18.970
But they’re definitely the one’s I feel
the most connected to.

